[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:Success Story]
[00:13.11]What was Frank's first job?
[00:18.64]Yesterday afternoon
[00:20.96]Frank Hawkins was telling me about his experiences as a young man.
[00:27.86]Before he retired, Frank was the head of a very large business company, but as a boy he used to work in a small shop.
[00:39.79]It was his job to repair bicycles and at that time he used to work fourteen hours a day.
[00:49.58]He saved money for years and in 1958 he bought a small workshop of his own.
[00:59.09]In his twenties Frank used to make spare parts for aeroplanes.
[01:05.80]At that time he had two helpers.
[01:09.93]In a few years the small workshop had become a large factory which employed seven hundred and twenty-eight people.
[01:20.09]Frank smiled when he remembered his hard early years and the long road to success.
[01:27.33]He was still smiling when the door opened and his wife came in.
[01:32.61]She wanted him to repair their grandson's bicycle!
